Z||000005||CoolBlue87GT||12-29-2001||12:02 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierobruiser:<BR><B>I'm sure you'd like to see your museum piece, "My 87 Fiero GT w/ only 1700 miles was chosen Best of Stock, Best Stock Paint, & Best of Show !!!!!", on TV.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, I'd like them to come to a show like Daytona, or Carlisle and get all the different models and interview <B>all the owners.</B><P>My intent to contact them was not about me or my car.  It was to have a show produced about the history of the Fiero, and the people the how we all enjoy them in different forms.<P>The history is really something that should be documented. <P>So to all, get this, it's not about me or my car. <B>IT'S FOR ALL THE FIEROS'S.</B>||||reg||1
